{
  "_doc": [
    "Shared test vectors for the scan rules in docs/opticloud-scans.md (Rules). The station app",
    "(apps/station/tests, ScanRulesVectorsTests) and the reports site (apps/web) both run every case,",
    "so the operators' screen and the web report pair scans the same way. Change a rule here first.",
    "",
    "Each case: name; now, todayStart (local midnight of now, as a UTC instant) and windowStart",
    "(now - 36h) as ISO 8601 UTC; maxOpen, optional: per station number (as a string key) the",
    "station's \"Max i gang\" setting, a station not listed has 1; events in, in any order; expected out.",
    "An event is one VentisolScans row: id (ScanId), barcode (12 digits), stationNo, station (name),",
    "stationKind (Assembly | Packing), direction (In | Out), time (ScanTime), durationSec (number or null).",
    "",
    "To run a case: drop events with time < windowStart (they are never read), pair the rest by the",
    "rules, then compare:",
    "  done: the work records that end today (end >= todayStart), each {barcode, stationNo, start, end};",
    "       compare sorted by end, then stationNo, then barcode.",
    "  inProgress: per station, its latest maxOpen Ins with no Out, over the whole window, each",
    "       {stationNo, barcode, since}; at most maxOpen per station (one at a station with 1);",
    "       compare sorted by stationNo, then since, then barcode.",
    "Times compare as instants (same millisecond), not as strings.",
    "",
    "Planned, not built yet (docs/plan-scan-commands.md and docs/plan-shift-end.md, opticloud-scans.md",
    "Events). A case with \"needs\": \"events\" (Session) or \"shift-end\" uses them; a suite skips it until",
    "it builds the rule (plan-scan-commands.md step 6 and 11; plan-shift-end.md step 5 and 9 run \"shift-end\").",
    "  event, optional on an event: the row's Event (Scan | Pause | Resume | Hold | CheckedOut | Undo |",
    "       ShiftEnd); missing means Scan. direction may then also be Mark (no time, never pairs).",
    "  A chain: passes of one element at one station joined where an Out with Pause is followed by an",
    "       In with Resume. A chain is one record: start its first In, end its last Out.",
    "  done entries gain activeSec (the sum of the chain's passes, compared when given) and endEvent",
    "       (the Event of the row that closed the record: its last Out, or the Mark that closed its",
    "       pause; missing means Scan; ShiftEnd means auto-stopped).",
    "       A chain still paused is not done.",
    "  paused, optional (missing means none): per station the elements whose last row is an Out with",
    "       Pause there, not closed by a Mark, not scanned anywhere since, the Out inside the window,",
    "       each {stationNo, barcode, since (the Pause Out), beforeSec (the chain's passes so far)};",
    "       compare sorted as inProgress.",
    "  inProgress entries gain beforeSec, compared when given: the chain's passes before its latest In.",
    "  A late Out: an Out with no open In, at most 12 h after a ShiftEnd Out of the same element at the",
    "       same station with no In between, ends that record instead (endEvent Scan). Later than 12 h",
    "       it is skipped."
  ],
